WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.763
Your opponent plays online too? Here's how to bring in their Chess.com and Lichess games.

00:00:06.213 --> 00:00:09.001
On your opponent's page, tap Import Games.

00:00:09.451 --> 00:00:11.088
Choose Chess.com.

00:00:11.538 --> 00:00:13.793
Enter their Chess.com username.

00:00:14.243 --> 00:00:17.736
Choose how many recent games to fetch, up to two hundred.

00:00:18.186 --> 00:00:20.505
Then tap Import from Chess.com.

00:00:20.955 --> 00:00:23.936
It runs on our server, so you can close the page.

00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:26.449
Done. Fifty games imported.

00:00:26.899 --> 00:00:29.795
Lichess works the same way. Tap Lichess,

00:00:30.245 --> 00:00:32.479
enter their username, and import.

00:00:32.929 --> 00:00:38.192
Now their over-the-board and online games sit together, ready to filter and prepare from.

00:00:38.642 --> 00:00:43.095
All their games, in one place. Try it at chesspreparatory.com.
